Milestone: Playable Nintendo DS beside the existing GBA on the desk.
Dependencies: None; retain the existing static-site and GBA behavior.

Purpose:
Add Nintendo DS emulation and a reference-matched metallic teal console with
stylus beside the retained GBA. The new request supersedes the earlier deferral
for this workstream only. Deliver locally; release/public compatibility is separate.

